/**
 * AI SEO & Search Visibility — beginner lessons for
 * Module 7 (AI-Assisted Technical SEO) and Module 8 (Measuring AI Visibility
 * and Staying Ahead).
 *
 * Written for a wide, mostly non-native-English audience: short sentences,
 * British spelling, an everyday analogy in every lesson, and the two running
 * demo businesses — Rosie's Bakery (Bristol) and StepRight Shoes (Leeds).
 *
 * Accuracy notes (content is current as of 2026 and says so where the ground
 * is moving): Core Web Vitals thresholds are LCP <= 2.5s, INP <= 200ms and
 * CLS <= 0.1 at the 75th percentile of field data; FAQ rich results have been
 * heavily restricted since 2023, so FAQPage markup is taught for clarity and
 * machine parsing rather than as a guaranteed rich result; Google-Extended
 * does not control AI Overviews eligibility; and AI assistants publish no
 * rankings, so measurement means repeated sampling, not a rank tracker.
 */
